        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, our business model relies significantly on software deployment, system integration and third-party hardware ecosystems rather than traditional manufacturing.",
        "start_character": 45959,
        "end_character": 46129
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because our energy orchestration services depend on integration with devices, utilities, aggregators and market operators, we rely on a network of integration partners, installers, device manufacturers and software providers to support the deployment and operation of the AMPX platform.",
        "start_character": 46613,
        "end_character": 46899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we fail to comply with applicable FDA or other requirements at any point during development, testing, review, approval or after approval, we may become subject to administrative or judicial sanctions, including warning letters, license suspension or revocation, product recalls, seizures, injunctions, fines, civil penalties or criminal prosecution.",
        "start_character": 54908,
        "end_character": 55260
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In October 2016, we completed our initial public offering and listed our Common Stock on the Nasdaq Capital Market.",
        "start_character": 35199,
        "end_character": 35314
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our acquisition accounting, we recognized identifiable intangible assets that included developed technology and trade name rights associated with the acquired business.",
        "start_character": 41491,
        "end_character": 41662
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Prior to the completion of the rescission transaction involving ImmunogenX, our business included the Latiglutenase and CypCel programs, and prior to 2025 we also held intellectual property relating to Niclosamide-based development programs and licensed rights relating to Capeserod.",
        "start_character": 43326,
        "end_character": 43609
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are no longer actively developing the Latiglutenase, CypCel, Capeserod or Niclosamide programs, and following the completion of the rescission transaction involving ImmunogenX, LLC on December 31, 2025, the Latiglutenase and CypCel intellectual property is no longer part of our business.",
        "start_character": 38754,
        "end_character": 39045
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that multiple contract manufacturers may be capable of producing Adrulipase drug substance and drug product for future clinical development if the program is advanced.",
        "start_character": 44842,
        "end_character": 45020
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the principal protectable value of this business resides in developed software, algorithms, platform architecture, implementation know-how, copyrights, trade secrets, brands and contractual rights.",
        "start_character": 41663,
        "end_character": 41871
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "changes could reduce the commercial potential of any pharmaceutical product we may successfully develop and obtain approval for in the future.",
        "start_character": 63942,
        "end_character": 64084
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Adrulipase is a secreted lipase naturally produced by Yarrowia lipolytica, known as LIP2, that we are developing through recombinant DNA technology for the treatment of EPI associated with CF and CP.",
        "start_character": 20204,
        "end_character": 20403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-054106",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-054106-af7fd6d6e5818fe4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-054106",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, any future clinical development activities we may conduct in France, including any future development activity relating to Adrulipase, would be subject not only to European Union clinical trial regulation, but also to French requirements relating to site agreements, investigator and institution interactions, personal data protection, transparency reporting and anti-benefit restrictions.",
        "start_character": 77318,
